    "title": "fix(theme): theme:compile post directory cleanup",
    "body": "Runs the unused theme directory cleanup after `theme:compile` and `theme:change`. The daily `theme.delete_files` scheduled task does not run reliably in some environments (theme compiled during a deploy step, admin worker without an open Administration), so old `theme/<hash>` directories pile up. Directories whose files are older than 24 hours are deleted. `--no-cleanup` keeps the previous behaviour.",
